<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cannondale, GT Bicycles start.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cannondale, GT Bicycles start.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Wednesday analyst Joe Grillo had started coverage of Cannondale Corp with a rating of strong buy and of GT Bicycles Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Cannondale closed at 20-3/4 on Tuesday and in GT Bicycles at 12-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
